      "{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"FAQPage\",\n  \"mainEntity\": [\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"What is BSI ART/1?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"BSI's AI Risk Toolkit (ART/1) is the UK's emerging voluntary framework for evaluating AI system risk before deployment \u2014 spanning risk identification, scoring, mitigation planning, and audit-ready evidence packaging \u2014 and is becoming a de facto pre-qualification for UK public-sector AI procurement.\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}"
